# Kernel talkman

- Tree: `kernel/mmo/msm8994`, `mmo_defconfig`. Remote **archienz** only. Never `git push origin` (Android4Lumia950).
- Author: archienz `<archienz@users.noreply.github.com>`.
- Never `CONFIG_MSM_OIS`. Never MTP GPIO 91/92. Never CSID test-generator.
- Rear CSI `qcom,csi-lane-assign = <0x0423>`. Mount-angle 90. CSIPHY MISC1 stock CAF.
